{"words": [{"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And (do) not"}, {"text": "تَقْرَبُوا۟", "translation": "go near"}, {"text": "مَالَ", "translation": "wealth"}, {"text": "ٱلْيَتِيمِ", "translation": "(of) the orphans"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "بِٱلَّتِى", "translation": "with that"}, {"text": "هِىَ", "translation": "which"}, {"text": "أَحْسَنُ", "translation": "(is) best"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "يَبْلُغَ", "translation": "he reaches"}, {"text": "أَشُدَّهُۥ ۖ", "translation": "his maturity"}, {"text": "وَأَوْفُوا۟", "translation": "And give full"}, {"text": "ٱلْكَيْلَ", "translation": "[the] measure"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمِيزَانَ", "translation": "and the weight"}, {"text": "بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۖ", "translation": "with justice"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "نُكَلِّفُ", "translation": "We burden"}, {"text": "نَفْسًا", "translation": "any soul"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "وُسْعَهَا ۖ", "translation": "(to) its capacity"}, {"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قُلْتُمْ", "translation": "you speak"}, {"text": "فَٱعْدِلُوا۟", "translation": "then be just"}, {"text": "وَلَوْ", "translation": "even if"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "he is"}, {"text": "ذَا", "translation": "(one of)"}, {"text": "قُرْبَىٰ ۖ", "translation": "a near relative"}, {"text": "وَبِعَهْدِ", "translation": "And (the) Covenant"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "أَوْفُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "fulfil"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكُمْ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "وَصَّىٰكُم", "translation": "(He) has enjoined on you"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "with it"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translation": "so that you may"}, {"text": "تَذَكَّرُونَ", "translation": "remember"}], "sahih": "And do not approach the orphan's property except in a way that is best [i.e., intending improvement] until he reaches maturity. And give full measure and weight in justice. We do not charge any soul except [with that within] its capacity. And when you speak [i.e., testify], be just, even if [it concerns] a near relative. And the covenant of Allāh fulfill. This has He instructed you that you may remember."}